      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Highlandtown%2C_Baltimore",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1919 Highlandtown was annexed into Baltimore City, ending its village status.",
